**DM_guarantee ($\Gamma$)** {

    **for** (each $\tau_i \in \Gamma$) {

        $I_i = \sum_{k=1}^{i-1} C_k$;

    **do** {

        $R_i = I_i + C_i$;

        **if** $(R_i > D_i)$ return(UNSCHEDULABLE);

        $I_i = \sum_{k=1}^{i-1} \left\lceil \frac{R_i}{T_k} \right\rceil C_k$;

    } **while** $(I_i + C_i > R_i)$;

    }

    return(SCHEDULABLE);

}

Figure 4.17 Algorithm for testing the schedulability of a periodic task set $\Gamma$ under Deadline Monotonic.
